azahar: azahar ( 3ds Emulator )
azahar:
azahar: Azahar is an open-source 3DS emulator project based on Citra.
azahar:
azahar: Citra/Azahar are an open-source Nintendo 3DS emulator/debugger
azahar: written in C++. It is written with portability in mind, with builds
azahar: actively maintained for Windows, Linux and OS X. Citra only emulates
azahar: a subset of 3DS hardware, and therefore is generally only useful for
azahar: running/debugging homebrew applications.
azahar:
